  "checklist": "# KDP paperback checklist: Harbour Light Word Searches\n\nPrepared by PuzzlePress 0.1.0 for manual submission in Amazon KDP. Nothing on this list has been done in KDP. PuzzlePress does not contact Amazon; KDP reviews the book and decides whether to publish it.\n\nReadiness: Ready for manual KDP submission: the supported KDP checks passed and the author's confirmations are complete. Amazon KDP reviews and decides.\n\nPublishing identity: `pp1-publishing-sha256-98d39a3a1fa6c99cc84fe328fb1f86365ffa548b80981fb2aeba87c19027f2a0`\n\nWork through KDP's three pages in order: Paperback Details, Paperback Content, and Paperback Rights & Pricing. Values come from `metadata.json`.\n\n## 1. Paperback details\n\n- [ ] On your KDP Bookshelf, create a paperback (or open this title's paperback draft).\n- [ ] Language: English\n- [ ] Book title: Harbour Light Word Searches\n- [ ] Subtitle: Twenty puzzles from the coast\n- [ ] Series: none\n- [ ] Edition number: 1\n- [ ] Primary author: PuzzlePress Examples\n- [ ] Contributors: none\n- [ ] Description (275 of 4,000 characters, plain text): paste it, then check the paragraphs in KDP's editor.\n    > Twenty word searches from harbour walls, tide pools, dunes and lighthouse paths. Each puzzle has its own large-print page with a themed word list, and every grid is generated deterministically and independently verified.\n    >\n    > Solutions are at the back of the book, two to a page.\n- [ ] Publishing rights: choose the option that applies to this book. PuzzlePress does not model public-domain content.\n- [ ] Sexually explicit images or title: No\n- [ ] Reading age: leave unset\n- [ ] Primary marketplace: choose in KDP (not modeled by PuzzlePress).\n- [ ] Categories: select up to three in KDP's category selector. Your saved preferences (not verified as currently available):\n    - Humor & Entertainment > Puzzles & Games > Word Search\n- [ ] Low-content book: leave unchecked\n- [ ] Keywords (5 of 7), one per box:\n    1. coastal word puzzles\n    2. harbour vocabulary\n    3. seaside activity for adults\n    4. lighthouse and sailing words\n    5. tide pool word games\n- [ ] AI-generated content: answer KDP's question from your declaration:\n    - Text: created by people (no disclosure required)\n    - Images: created by people (no disclosure required)\n    - Translations: not a translation (not applicable)\n\n## 2. Paperback content\n\n- [ ] ISBN: get a free KDP ISBN. KDP assigns the number; it can be used only on KDP and lists the imprint as Independently published.\n- [ ] Ink and paper: black ink on white paper\n- [ ] Trim size: 8.5 x 11 in\n- [ ] Bleed settings: No bleed (the interior has none; the cover has its own)\n- [ ] Paperback cover finish: choose matte or glossy (not modeled by PuzzlePress)\n- [ ] Manuscript: upload `interior.pdf` (35 pages, SHA-256 4f8f9baf9bb8e83c23101a644842ed70d91cc5ddb0b8862ca97c396d62d87e80).\n- [ ] Book cover: choose to upload a print-ready PDF cover and upload `cover.pdf`, 17.3288 x 11.25 in with a 0.0788 in spine (SHA-256 5dcaf42d430cac877dd7acf1ba5ed99d393e7ab377f34d7d76e22b18c6ce5ba2).\n- [ ] Launch KDP's Print Previewer. Check every page, the spine, margins and the barcode area.\n- [ ] Review every issue the Previewer reports. PuzzlePress checks do not replace KDP's.\n- [ ] Approve the preview only after reviewing it yourself.\n\n## 3. Rights and pricing\n\n- [ ] Territories, pricing and royalty: decide in KDP (not modeled by PuzzlePress).\n- [ ] Order a printed proof (optional in KDP) to check color, trim and binding before publishing; the cover is RGB and KDP prints CMYK.\n- [ ] Submit for publishing yourself when satisfied. KDP then reviews the book.\n\n## Warnings to review\n\n- [isbn_imprint] With a free KDP ISBN, KDP lists the imprint as 'Independently published', not 'PuzzlePress Demonstration'. The imprint printed on your cover is unchanged.\n- [interior_warnings] Interior: 3 font(s) are subset-embedded. Review against KDP's wording; subsets contain every glyph the interior uses.\n- [cover_warnings] Cover: The photograph is RGB; KDP recommends CMYK and converts RGB itself. Review color in a printed proof.\n- [categories_unverified] Categories are saved preferences. KDP's list differs by marketplace and format and changes over time; confirm each one is available when you select it in KDP.\n\n## Your confirmations recorded in book.yaml\n\n- Confirmed: I hold the rights to publish this book's text, word lists and cover photograph.\n- Confirmed: I reviewed the AI content declaration above, and it is accurate.\n- Confirmed: The description, keywords and categories accurately represent this book.\n\nThese are your statements. PuzzlePress cannot verify rights, authorship, ISBN registration or the accuracy of an AI declaration.\n",
